<div class="page-header"><h1>Become a Kitchen Cabinet Dealer in Denver, CO</h1><p>Pinnacle Sales is the manufacturer's representative for five premium cabinetry brands — Shiloh, Eclipse, Aspect, Pronorm German Kitchens, and Vistora Closets — recruiting and supporting kitchen & bath dealers across Denver and the Front Range.</p></div>
<div class="content-narrow section">
<Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs} />

<h2 id="why-partner-with-pinnacle">Why Partner With Pinnacle Sales in Denver</h2>
<p>If you run a kitchen & bath showroom or design studio in Denver, Pinnacle Sales gives you a portfolio that spans every market tier — from semi-custom value to handleless German luxury — backed by 23+ years of hands-on dealer support. From Cherry Creek and Wash Park to the Highlands and the southern suburbs, Denver kitchens lean transitional with a growing appetite for handleless European fronts, and we offer protected territory, line training, and the design and merchandising help your team needs to win those projects.</p>

<h2 id="lines-you-can-carry">Premium Lines You Can Carry</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/shiloh-cabinetry/">Shiloh Cabinetry</a></strong> — The most versatile choice for Denver's transitional look: custom paint, broad wood species, face-frame and <a href="/playbook/modern-inset/">inset</a> options.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry/">Eclipse Cabinetry</a></strong> — Frameless, full-access cabinetry for clean contemporary Denver remodels that need maximum storage.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens/">Pronorm German Kitchens</a></strong> — Handleless, precision-engineered fronts for high-end Cherry Creek and Cherry Hills projects, with protected territory and strong dealer margins.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/aspect-cabinetry/">Aspect Cabinetry</a></strong> — Semi-custom value for builder and investment-property kitchens.</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="denver-market-opportunity">The Denver Market Opportunity</h2>
<p>The Denver metro favors transitional kitchens that pair painted uppers (white, greige, soft black) with warm walnut or natural-oak islands and lowers. Two-tone schemes dominate, and inset construction is increasingly requested for its furniture-quality look. In luxury pockets — Cherry Creek, Cherry Hills Village, Hilltop — handleless German systems and slab-front contemporary kitchens are gaining ground, a high-margin opportunity for dealers carrying the <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry/">frameless full-access</a> and <a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens/">handleless German</a> lines that fit the market.</p>

<h2 id="dealer-support">Dealer Support That Drives Sales</h2>
<p>Pinnacle Sales backs Denver dealers with hands-on sales training, 2020/Winner design and quoting support, showroom display programs, and ongoing business development. We work alongside your team to move projects from concept to order.</p>

